  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Inclusive Local Voices: Enhancing Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has two strategic objectives: (1) enhancing meaningful participation of women, youth, and PWDs in leadership and decision-making through gender norm transformation, and (2) strengthening economic resilience through expanded Village Savings and Loan Associations (VSLA) and transition to registered cooperatives.  15 traditional male leaders trained in gender-transformative leadership to become advocates for inclusive participation. Exisiting women&apos;s groups and groups of PWD will recieve leadership training and livlihood interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
